  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4302.11 Import",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4302.11 \"Import\" means the conveyance of oil into New Hampshire by any means, by or on behalf of a licensed distributor, for purposes of distribution, sale or use in the state. Distribution, sale or use includes any transfer of ownership of oil from a licensed distributor to another licensee or other person.\n\nSource. #10026, eff 11-16-11 (from Saf-C 4302.07); ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4300.html"
